izace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5159f21", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "9ff88e5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "152579d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7e2a4e2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "949eacd", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "e263a1d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "fae3007", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "47ab214", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4fdae52", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c8dbe9b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "07452d5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5dd1c04", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6d5f401", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9c7d30e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "bce2343", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2bf01d3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1a911ba", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "216657b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Při realizaci webu pro firmu Břinčil jsme kladli důraz na moderní a přehledný design, snadnou orientaci návštěvníků a kvalitní prezentaci společnosti i její techniky. Nový web zároveň slouží jako podpůrná prezentace hlavní společnosti Břinčil &amp; Míka s.r.o., pro kterou jsme v minulosti rovněž realizovali kompletní online prezentaci.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "bc623a8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "brincil.cz", "link": {"url": "https://brincil.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "a858bde", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-refs-more ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f1ede0e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Další weby, e-shopy a kampaně najdete v portfoliu Yesmark.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "251b618", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Všechny reference", "link": {"url": "https://yesmark.eu/reference/?utm_source=wwwwww.cz&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wwwwww_reference&utm_content=homepage_all", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--dark ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "883636b", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "cenik"}, "elements": [{"id": "6b71271", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-price", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "0fb6c49", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-price-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "b93fb87", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cena", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7eb65a0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "<small>Web pro umělce a muzikanta</small>od 9 900 Kč", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-price-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6895187", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Konečná cena záleží na počtu stránek, funkcích (rezervace, e-shop, jazyky) a grafice. Nabídku vám připravíme zdarma.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1073341", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5ff6f8e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci cenovou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "b5a5e0a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d428e30", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Časté otázky – web pro umělce a muzikanta", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "41016ab", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "toggle", "settings": {"faq_schema": "yes", "tabs": [{"_id": "bc56848", "tab_title": "Co je press kit a proč ho mít na webu?", "tab_content": "<p>Balíček fotek, bia a technických informací pro pořadatele a média. Ušetří vám desítky e-mailů.</p>"}, {"_id": "1b49988", "tab_title": "Jde prodávat obrazy nebo merch?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano – i jednoduchý e-shop s pár položkami a online platbou.</p>"}, {"_id": "c2e9c9c", "tab_title": "Jak dlouho trvá vytvoření webu – umělec / muzikant?", "tab_content": "<p>Jednodušší web bývá hotový za 2–4 týdny, rozsáhlejší s rezervacemi nebo e-shopem za 4–8 týdnů. Přesný harmonogram dostanete v nabídce.</p>"}, {"_id": "1074596", "tab_title": "Budu si web upravovat sám?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano. Stavíme na WordPressu a Elementoru – texty, ceník, fotky i nové stránky změníte sami a ukážeme vám, jak na to.</p>"}, {"_id": "e45b856", "tab_title": "Tvoříte weby jen v Jeseníku?", "tab_content": "<p>Sídlíme v Jeseníku, ale weby tvoříme pro klienty z celé České republiky. Spolupráce běží online, místní rádi potkáme osobně.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "8c67a09", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "4ab6380", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a0cfa09", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a15381d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "665112b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Poptávka", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0fa65b1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Chcete web pro umělce a muzikanta?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "6cc7f9c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Napište pár vět o svém podnikání nebo rovnou zavolejte. Ozvu s